@startuml
' Report 4: supporting interaction
title RAG-ANSWER - Prepare an answer with retrieved knowledge
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #202020
 LifeLineBorderColor #777777
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor #202020
 ActorBackgroundColor white
 ActorBorderColor #202020
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor #444444
 ReferenceBackgroundColor white
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #777777
participant "RAGService" as AI
participant "VectorStoreService" as VS
database "ChromaDB\n(proposed)" as CH
participant "OpenAI API" as OA
caption Existing + proposed extension - target design, not a claim of complete implementation
activate AI
group 1. Evaluate conditions
opt 1.1 Question is not a greeting
note over AI
Proposed extension: Planned ChromaDB retrieval.
end note
AI -> VS : 1.1.1. Find relevant knowledge passages
activate VS
VS -> CH : 1.1.2. Search indexed passages
activate CH
CH -->> VS : 1.1.3. Matching passages
deactivate CH
VS -->> AI : 1.1.4. Matching passages
deactivate VS
end
end
alt 1.2 OpenAI configured and usable
AI -> OA : 1.2.1. Generate answer using question and context
activate OA
OA -->> AI : 1.2.2. Answer or service error
deactivate OA
opt 1.2.2.1 Completion request fails
note over AI
Prepare the source-defined fallback answer.
end note
end
else 1.3 OpenAI unavailable
note over AI
Prepare the source-defined fallback answer.
end note
end
deactivate AI
' Source references:
' ai-service/app/services/rag_service.py:108 def ask
' ai-service/app/services/vector_store.py:143 similarity_search
@enduml
